{"id":2823,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>薪火赓续八十五载，诗韵激扬五四青春。值此中国共产主义青年团成立104周年、建校85周年之际，为传承五四精神、厚植青年家国情怀，5月8日晚，人文社会科学学院在科艺苑隆重举办“纪念建校85周年校庆暨五四青春诗会展演”活动。全校七百余名师生齐聚一堂，以诗为媒、以声传情，重温红色校史，致敬五四先驱，共贺学校华诞。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SM7UzsUzQVnz7bnlm62Mz74Mmr2oRLr4Ll7ZnR9iLmlDozv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkybMShRLYybM8LYnzGsUl-so7MRUzWkL8V2MRGsUzU4M4WFnRAfLRlYU4rFMllPL4lJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLm9sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/495C397C2E07AB78CCA2B3AF407A4372/D8A052C5/5E135\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SU4nz7Uz-4U4VVnl7rVMzNsozCPU4LrZLlL4nRQ2n778M8L0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yan1yboky4Ul-ZMNUZnRM2oz9so7MRnzLYnRnVollaMlMFUllsnRUioRTFLm9ZL4MfgtXaQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz-ZMYbw62I8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次展演活动以“诗咏青年鸿志远，歌承五四赤心长”为主题，精选15部优秀作品登上舞台，融合朗诵、歌舞、情景剧等多种艺术表现形式，兼具思想性与观赏性。舞台上，表演者以饱满的热情，回溯了学校从太行工业学校一路走来的峥嵘岁月，重现了烽火年代里中北人矢志不渝、报国为民的赤诚初心。此次活动还特别邀请了中北大学附属学校学子，他们带来的情景剧《军礼》以感人至深的演绎致敬革命先辈，合唱《山河》用磅礴激昂的歌声表达对守护这片土地的英雄儿女的崇高敬业，为诗会增添了浓厚的红色情怀与艺术感染力 。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SnR6zVoRNDnmGPLlzUZMmT7Lzr7UlnrVM4vsL77solLZMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybUYysLYyYUmG4MRW7MRGYM8CsLmvZLRlsnNlZM8QkU8rFLzLZUmWfozQFMzCPUmCJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLm9sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D9C732B0342D4027F7278057FE87FBCE/138B2A96/561B6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUz9zinm-iLml8Ul47sMNlDMRNDn7VrkUllPM4-DLzWfMlL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDnkhRUYhko7UYM4UDozr2M7l4MN-4LN74UNQkL8WkUzrFLmrRnm-boznFLzU4UmNigtXaQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz-ZMYbw62I8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUNrzVM7lPnlVfLlRC4oRL8Lz62U8-rPMm9anmG8MNUDoRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVoSh2MYyDLR7PU8UsM4M2LmL4MRM7UzvYMRA2UmW7U4fFoz9PMmNZoznFMzNbUzCJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLm9sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0E9F76011CD773F23343DA7248FB2DC0/98169894/599A6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SozTzVL4CbMlQVMl4C8MRTfLmLbolCr8L8-8olLYnNCDU470gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkL1h7LSy8L7UsMRfRLlUbUz9bM8CZLzT7U4GPU46Rn7MFLmlanmMkUm6FLlr2MRT7gtXaQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz-ZMYbw62I8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次展演，深度融合了中北大学85载厚重校史底蕴与五四精神的青春活力，鲜活诠释了新时代中北青年赓续红色血脉、勇担时代重任的青春风貌，既是一次深刻的爱国主义教育，更是一场凝聚青春力量、激发奋进斗志的动员大会。未来，学院将以此次诗会为契机，持续引导广大青年传承红色基因、厚植家国情怀、锤炼过硬本领、勇担时代使命，以青春之我、奋斗之我，投身学校“双一流”创建实践，为强国建设、民族复兴伟业贡献中北青年的智慧和力量。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://shss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SM7UzsUzQVnz7bnlm62Mz74Mmr2oRLr4Ll7ZnR9iLmlDozv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkybMShRLYybM8LYnzGsUl-so7MRUzWkL8V2MRGsUzU4M4WFnRAfLRlYU4rFMllPL4lJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLm9sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11287&e=.jpg"}